stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> raw
  state "Raw idea" as raw
  state "Restated in our words" as restated
  state "Approved to build" as approved
  state "Specs written" as specced
  state "Gates passed" as gated
  state "Sent to a runner" as dispatched
  state "Draft verified" as verified
  state "Rejected" as rejected
  state "Parked" as parked
  approved --> specced: the idea becomes specs
  approved --> parked: you park it
  dispatched --> parked: you park it
  dispatched --> rejected: the runner rejects it
  dispatched --> verified: the draft checks out
  gated --> verified: every spec is verified
  gated --> dispatched: you send a draft packet
  gated --> specced: a gate fails
  gated --> parked: you park it
  raw --> parked: you park it
  raw --> restated: you restate the idea
  restated --> approved: you approve the smallest slice
  restated --> parked: you park it
  specced --> gated: the gates pass
  specced --> parked: you park it
  verified --> gated: the idea opens again
  verified --> dispatched: the draft is no longer a draft
